## igor.mauricio.eng@gmail.com

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User igor.mauricio.eng@gmail.com
PassCmd "security find-generic-password -a igor.mauricio.eng@gmail.com -s gmail -w"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

MaildirStore local
Inbox ~/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Maildir++

IMAPStore gmail
Account gmail

Channel primary
Far :gmail:
Near :local:
Patterns INBOX "[Gmail]/Sent Mail" "[Gmail]/Trash" "[Gmail]/Spam"
# Create Both
# Expunge Both   # enable only after testing


## contato@igormauricio.com
IMAPAccount hostinger
Host imap.hostinger.com
User contato@igormauricio.com
PassCmd "security find-generic-password -a contato@igormauricio.com -s hostinger -w"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

MaildirStore local-hostinger
Inbox ~/mail/hostinger/INBOX
SubFolders Maildir++

IMAPStore hostinger
Account hostinger

Channel hostinger-primary
Far :hostinger:
Near :local-hostinger:
Patterns INBOX Sent Drafts Trash Junk
Create Near
# Expunge Both   # enable only after testing
